#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, typeRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:281
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel37)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:241
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, typeRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:281
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel37)
#: rc.cpp:1222 rc.cpp:1251
msgid ""
"Regular expression to find the type of the element. The pattern is searched "
"on the result of the <i>DefinitionRx</i> match and the first captured area "
"will hold the element type.<br>\n"
"Example (simplified):<br>\n"
"<b>DefinitionRx=\\$+([a-zA-Z]+)=new\\\\s[a-zA-Z]+;<br>\n"
"TypeRx=new\\\\s([a-zA-Z]+);</b><br><br>\n"
"This will match strings like <b>$fooObj=new foo;</b>. Now this string is "
"searched and it will find <b>new foo;</b>, where <b>foo</b> is the first "
"captured text (the regular expression matching <b>foo</b> is between "
"brackets).<br>\n"
"So the type of <b>$fooObj</b> is <b>foo</b>."
msgstr ""

