#~ "<p>...that Quanta has a local script library for useful scripts? "
#~ "<b>Select the scripts tree on the left</b> and you will find scripts and "
#~ "Kommander dialogs for doc generation, Quick Start, XSL Transforms and "
#~ "more.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
