#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>...that you can create text templates using <b>Drag and Drop </b>? "
#~ "Have your template tree open, select some text, drag it to the tree and "
#~ "drop it on a folder. Quanta will prompt you for a file name.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>...ки метавон қолибҳои матниро бо ёрии <b>гузаронидан ва мондан</b> "
